# L §8.2 before from:, E §3.2 (tally 2.1.7 R7, issue #146; F15): a lifespan read is in the read set, the
# entries that state it: pay before from reads ola's lifespan, which the branch ends, and is listed; a movement the
# branch removes is listed with it. 2.1.6's refcore refused ENGINE-INVARIANT (invariant 3). (T's G10 f_life.)
=== f_life.tally
model life
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "G10 review probe (invented): a movement before from reads lifespan(k) of a thing the scenario changes"

source card "the reviewer's card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind persons: parties

input pay_day: date

input amt: money PLN

input cutoff: date

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  when lifespan(ola).to != never
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

move pay2: transfers
  on pay_day
  when lifespan(ola).to == never
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt + amt

ask b0: bal(konto, 2026-06-30)

ask l0: lifespan(ola).to

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ola] lives 1980-01-01..
  pay_day = 2026-02-01 "the card"
  amt = 10.00 PLN "the card"
  cutoff = 2026-07-01 "the card"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
=== f_life_s.tally
scenario ends over life
  tally 2
  from 2026-07-01

version ends_v
  cite card
  known 2026-01-01
  replace persons + [ola] lives 1980-01-01..2026-09-30

ask b1: bal(konto, 2026-06-30) in ends

ask l1: lifespan(ola).to in ends
=== expect
b0: 20.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pay2
  cut 2026-03-01
b1: 10.00 PLN
  world: ends
  before from: pay on 2026-02-01 reads ola
  before from: pay2 on 2026-02-01 removed by ends
  unfulfilled: pay
  cut 2026-03-01
l0: never
  cut 2026-03-01
l1: 2026-09-30
  world: ends
  cut 2026-03-01
warning: WARN-UNREAD input cutoff is read by nothing
